{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "PSA",
 "chapter": 7,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.2",
   "range": "PSA.7.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a90b0daf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.2#p1-a90b0daf",
     "text": "He desires God to deliver him from the rage of cruel Saul.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "he tear my soul like a"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.3",
   "range": "PSA.7.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "05381fd2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.3#p1-05381fd2",
     "text": "With which Cush charges me.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "this"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.4",
   "range": "PSA.7.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ed7089a0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.4#p1-ed7089a0",
     "text": "If I did not reverence Saul for affinities sake, and preserved his life, 1Sa 26:8,9.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "If I have rewarded evil unto",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 26:8,9",
       "ref": "1SA.26.8"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Sa 26:8,9",
       "ref": "1SA.26.9"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.5",
   "range": "PSA.7.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "42c389f2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.5#p1-42c389f2",
     "text": "Let me not only die, but be dishonoured forever.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "honour in the dust"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.6",
   "range": "PSA.7.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7b165003",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.6#p1-7b165003",
     "text": "In promising me the kingdom.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "judgment that thou hast commanded"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.7",
   "range": "PSA.7.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "83adfe4b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.7#p1-83adfe4b",
     "text": "Not only for mine, but for your Church's sake declare your power.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "return thou on high"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.8",
   "range": "PSA.7.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c030c7cf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.8#p1-c030c7cf",
     "text": "As concerning my behaviour towards Saul and my enemies.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "righteousness"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.9",
   "range": "PSA.7.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fadaf8dc",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.9#p1-fadaf8dc",
     "text": "Though they pretend a just cause against me, yet God will judge their hypocrisy.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "hearts and reins"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.11",
   "range": "PSA.7.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "41e174ca",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.11#p1-41e174ca",
     "text": "He continually calls the wicked to repentance by some sign of his judgments.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "every day"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.12",
   "range": "PSA.7.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "481cda71",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.12#p1-481cda71",
     "text": "Unless Saul changes his mind, I will die, for he has both the men and weapons to destroy me. Thus considering his great danger, he magnifies God's grace.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "he turn not"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.7.17",
   "range": "PSA.7.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e9e1d71e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.7.17#p1-e9e1d71e",
     "text": "In faithfully keeping his promise to me.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "righteousness"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
